EXTERNAL Name(charname)

{Name("Winston")}
This drink looks about as gross as you do, gnome!

{Name("Rana")}
Ok, now that was just mean.

{Name("Winston")}
You know what?!

{Name("Rana")}
What?

{Name("Winston")}
Jesse, he’s been the bane of my existence for years!

{Name("Rana")}
He’ll stop you!

{Name("Winston")}
Always getting more love from the Sheriff than me.

{Name("Rana")}
I- I don’t think that was your next line.

{Name("Winston")}
I’m gonna cadaverify him!

{Name("Rana")}
Hey man, you sure you don’t want to talk about this?

{Name("Winston")}
Thank you for instilling this wisdom in me, gnome!

{Name("Rana")}
Ew, no, I didn’t help with this at all.

{Name("Winston")}
Adios, hermano!